| Path | Description | GitSync Origin |
|------|-------------|----------------|
| `src/services/LegacyGitPurgeService.ts` | Purges legacy isomorphic-git data | New (compatibility layer) |

Modifications to upstream GitSync code are marked with:
- Date of modification
- Source file path in this product
- Reference to the original GitSync path

This product intentionally purges all legacy isomorphic-git data including:
- All stored Git credentials and tokens
- All cloned repository directories
- All sync queues and operation registries
- All unpushed commit records

Test Debt
---------
The native git2-rs module (Rust + Expo bridge) does not yet have unit or
integration tests. The Rust crate is tested upstream in git2-rs; the Expo
binding layer and TypeScript client are covered manually during development
builds. A CI test gate will be added when the Rust FFI surface stabilises.

